{
  "language": "zh",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 6.58,
      "end": 10.38,
      "text": "我们今天对我们公司新出现了新出的一款这个手机",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 10.38,
      "end": 12.86,
      "text": "这个产品啊 进行一下这个颜导会",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 12.86,
      "end": 14.62,
      "text": "首先 咱们去了一下",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 14.62,
      "end": 18.38,
      "text": "咱们这个产品的目标 这个人群 客户群这一块",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 18.38,
      "end": 20.74,
      "text": "首先谈判 大家获得一个看法啊",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 20.74,
      "end": 24.54,
      "text": "那也谈一下吧",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 24.54,
      "end": 29.38,
      "text": "我觉得咱们这个 这个目标人群可以不用定的那么确定",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 29.38,
      "end": 33.1,
      "text": "然后基本上就是让他什么样什么类的人群",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 33.1,
      "end": 35.82,
      "text": "然后都可以 这样的咱们的面比较滚",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 36.66,
      "end": 40.38,
      "text": "因为咱们这个手机现在基本上外观设计的比较时尚",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 40.38,
      "end": 45.18,
      "text": "所以我觉得其实不用接定于这个老年人或者年轻人之间",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 45.18,
      "end": 46.5,
      "text": "这块都大一点是吧",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 46.5,
      "end": 48.94,
      "text": "对 这下我觉得范围更广一些",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 48.94,
      "end": 50.9,
      "text": "就是什么样的人群都可以选择吗",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 52.18,
      "end": 54.74,
      "text": "我觉得是要有针对性的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 54.74,
      "end": 58.18,
      "text": "我觉得咱们的设计外观还是很时尚",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 58.18,
      "end": 61.78,
      "text": "还是需要去设定一下",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 61.78,
      "end": 64.46,
      "text": "比较适合的年龄段",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 66.78,
      "text": "你方说因为它是有彩色的呀",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 66.78,
      "end": 67.98,
      "text": "有蓝色的黄色",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 67.98,
      "end": 69.78,
      "text": "你要老年人它不可能用这种颜色",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 69.78,
      "end": 71.78,
      "text": "也可以说是有一种反响",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 71.78,
      "end": 73.78,
      "text": "而且你现在设计的产品",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 73.78,
      "end": 76.58,
      "text": "主要推出的是它有招向的功能",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 76.58,
      "end": 79.66,
      "text": "功能的话是很很好",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 79.66,
      "end": 83.74,
      "text": "所以是还是适合年轻的人群",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 83.74,
      "end": 90.34,
      "text": "我感觉可以根据年龄和这种就是不同的人士做下去分",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 90.34,
      "end": 97.58,
      "text": "我感觉我们可以觉得真的就是18到45之岁的中青年人群吗",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 97.58,
      "end": 99.34,
      "text": "首先咱们就确定为这个手机",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 99.34,
      "end": 100.78,
      "text": "从这个特点来说",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 100.78,
      "end": 103.46,
      "text": "可能就是说年龄段快乐大一点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 103.46,
      "end": 107.34,
      "text": "但是我觉得就是现在老年人也都很时尚",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 107.34,
      "end": 108.78,
      "text": "你看现在老年人出去",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 108.78,
      "end": 111.18,
      "text": "然后它基本上把自己装树的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 111.18,
      "end": 112.58,
      "text": "然后都是大粉 大红",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 112.58,
      "end": 114.82,
      "text": "然后它很喜欢那个特别亮的年龄",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 114.82,
      "end": 116.74,
      "text": "年轻版是吧",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 116.74,
      "end": 121.02,
      "text": "但是现在的版本的话它是不适合老年人的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 121.02,
      "end": 122.06,
      "text": "你有一些功能",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 122.06,
      "end": 125.18,
      "text": "像老年人的话它需要很多的大自体",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 125.18,
      "end": 129.86,
      "text": "或者是一些网络上的东西老年人根本就快不了",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 129.86,
      "end": 130.7,
      "text": "它操作不了",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 130.7,
      "end": 133.94,
      "text": "对 它那个规格还是不一样的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 133.94,
      "end": 140.02,
      "text": "但是我觉得这个手机里面很多字的东西都是可以再去设的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 140.02,
      "end": 144.26,
      "text": "然后而且我觉得现在老年人也不是所有的老年人",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 144.26,
      "end": 147.58,
      "text": "都是那种眼花或者什么什么的情况",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 147.58,
      "end": 151.62,
      "text": "所以我觉得就是不用把这个界限弄得那么分明",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 151.62,
      "end": 152.98,
      "text": "然后基本上能适应它",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 152.98,
      "end": 156.82,
      "text": "然后能去使用它的老年人都还可以选择",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 156.82,
      "end": 158.98,
      "text": "但是我觉得还是有针对性的好",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 158.98,
      "end": 160.78,
      "text": "你现在买手机的话",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 160.78,
      "end": 163.06,
      "text": "它不一定都是说老年人自己去买",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 163.06,
      "end": 164.1,
      "text": "老年人根本就不会看",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 164.1,
      "end": 166.62,
      "text": "一般都是子女给家长去买",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 166.62,
      "end": 170.38,
      "text": "它会够查里面的一些功能什么的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 170.38,
      "end": 171.94,
      "text": "会不会去选择",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 172.82,
      "end": 174.86,
      "text": "我感觉我们可以根据就是不同的人",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 174.86,
      "end": 176.54,
      "text": "比如说一做一下差别设计",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 176.54,
      "end": 178.22,
      "text": "像如果老年人用的话",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 178.22,
      "end": 180.02,
      "text": "可以就是辟识收尾地点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 180.02,
      "end": 181.74,
      "text": "就是自己或者声音收尾大一点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 181.74,
      "end": 184.82,
      "text": "年轻人用的话就可能颜色选择性多点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 184.82,
      "end": 186.3,
      "text": "辟识高点这种",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 186.3,
      "end": 187.62,
      "text": "好 毫不随意",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 187.62,
      "end": 193.22,
      "text": "可以 好像这个就是跨度反正就不用特别大",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 193.22,
      "end": 194.14,
      "text": "从年轻人来说",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 194.14,
      "end": 196.34,
      "text": "等着主动年轻跨的一块吧",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 196.34,
      "end": 197.34,
      "text": "年轻人一块",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 197.34,
      "end": 201.14,
      "text": "18到35岁之间大家会觉得可以",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 201.14,
      "end": 202.62,
      "text": "45岁之间都可以 对吧",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 202.62,
      "end": 203.66,
      "text": "对",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 203.66,
      "end": 205.62,
      "text": "咱们机型我觉得还是适应",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 205.62,
      "end": 207.74,
      "text": "比较年轻化一点的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 209.42,
      "end": 212.02,
      "text": "那咱们后续在定一下",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 212.02,
      "end": 215.58,
      "text": "18到5岁之间的色彩原色",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 215.58,
      "end": 217.3,
      "text": "咱们都倒是去那一下这个颜色",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 217.3,
      "end": 218.5,
      "text": "好吗",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 218.5,
      "end": 221.5,
      "text": "首先咱们说促造方式这一块",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 221.5,
      "end": 223.74,
      "text": "大家觉得以示茫的促造方式",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 223.74,
      "end": 225.74,
      "text": "已经促销会均的好一些",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 226.54,
      "end": 227.78,
      "text": "咱们可以现在通过",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 227.78,
      "end": 229.46,
      "text": "比如说什么的直播待户",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 229.46,
      "end": 230.46,
      "text": "直播",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 230.46,
      "end": 232.98,
      "text": "不是 马上就电商双十英文",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 232.98,
      "end": 235.1,
      "text": "这种活动我们都可以多参与",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 235.1,
      "end": 237.18,
      "text": "就各大电商平台什么的",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 237.18,
      "end": 239.62,
      "text": "天波苏宁 陀宝 平多多",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 239.62,
      "end": 240.78,
      "text": "会不会有压力",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 240.78,
      "end": 242.58,
      "text": "方式一的时候会不会有压力",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 242.58,
      "end": 244.1,
      "text": "我们前期准备是",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 244.1,
      "end": 247.58,
      "text": "就是价钱可以让立一些",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 247.58,
      "end": 249.18,
      "text": "多占领些市场分额",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 249.18,
      "end": 250.42,
      "text": "等三分额",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "start": 250.42,
      "end": 252.38,
      "text": "妈妈坐牢之后就可以",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 252.38,
      "end": 253.78,
      "text": "价钱收益高点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 253.78,
      "end": 254.98,
      "text": "你没有什么方子",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 254.98,
      "end": 257.06,
      "text": "我觉得还是先要看一下",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 257.06,
      "end": 259.02,
      "text": "推出一下手机的亮点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 259.02,
      "end": 261.82,
      "text": "它有什么和其他的手机",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 261.82,
      "end": 263.3,
      "text": "有什么不同的地方",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 263.3,
      "end": 268.7,
      "text": "然后在一些电商给一些力度",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 268.7,
      "end": 272.02,
      "text": "比方说京东什么的给一个折扣",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 272.02,
      "end": 273.14,
      "text": "看有什么样的方式",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 273.14,
      "end": 276.18,
      "text": "进行处销",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 276.18,
      "end": 278.9,
      "text": "比如说他们现在搞了有低推",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 278.9,
      "end": 280.34,
      "text": "低推咱们与了早点马上",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 280.34,
      "end": 282.14,
      "text": "我觉得一个方向",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 282.14,
      "end": 283.38,
      "text": "你们可以谈一下自己",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 283.38,
      "end": 284.18,
      "text": "不同的一个",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 284.18,
      "end": 286.38,
      "text": "我感觉低推这个不太适合手机",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 286.38,
      "end": 288.98,
      "text": "手机房一般就是有门店这种",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "start": 289.42,
      "end": 291.54,
      "text": "或者就是因为低推太老套楼",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "start": 291.54,
      "end": 295.3,
      "text": "但是还是电商现在比较好一点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "start": 295.3,
      "end": 296.22,
      "text": "对 电商好一点",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "start": 296.22,
      "end": 298.22,
      "text": "然后我觉得可以就是那个",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 298.22,
      "end": 299.34,
      "text": "然后裤绑一些",
      "speaker": null
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 299.34,
      "end": 299.98,
      "text": "比如说",
      "speaker": null
    }
  ]
}
